Z||000005||AusFiero||05-12-2001||08:17 PM||||Now that is really nice in grey and woodgrain. <BR>I think I really do need a USA manufacturer. Lots of this stuff and more is so marketable and makeable. Lots of this stuff is also to big to ship from this country....Hmmm unless consolidated freight to the one outlet.<P>Way I am going I will have to close my web design firm nd get back into car parts only. <P>On interiors has anyone seen the nifty little voice control units available these days. Wondering how hard it would be to adapt voice control into a car. <P>I think the indicator stalk would be left though. Cant think of anything more annoying then telling your car where to go next. But imagine a dash with no switching at all.<P>Also seen a prototype Euro car once that didnt even have a steering wheel. It had a joystick near the drivers right hand. All the usual game style commands drove it. So if you suck at computer games. Don't drive in the future  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero.gif"> <BR>When I was young I spent 80% of my money on Women, Gambling and Alcohol. I guess I wasted the rest.||||reg||1
